Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a heavy stone lifted from my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because things seem to be working out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more present.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you almost dare believe in a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In this damn town,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,where you usually get crap and gunfire on your way home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it suddenly feels like you can actually breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The food is damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I eat more, I'll burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I should go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe sleep a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seduce me.
